sound W4.aac
text @[Misae]
text Your shoes are going to be soaked by the time you get home, you know.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's fine.
sound W5.aac
text @[Misae]
text Oh. Okay.
sound W6.aac
text @[Misae]
text Well, just don't catch a cold.
text @[Tomoya]
text Sure thing.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGMS10"
