	fi
fi
sound WJ.aac
text @[Rugby club]
text Okazaki, what the hell.
sound WK.aac
text @[Rugby club]
text What have you been teaching Misae-san?
text @[Tomoya]
text Teaching?
sound WL.aac
text @[Rugby club]
text You taught her some weird moves, didn't you?
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, the Giant Swing?
sound WM.aac
text @[Rugby club]
text That's not the only one.
sound WN.aac
text @[Rugby club]
text We saw you talking to Misae-san just now too.
sound WO.aac
text @[Rugby club]
text If you don't stop screwing around, we can make it so that you'll never be able to come back here, you know.
text @[Tomoya]
text There wouldn't be a problem in the first place if you didn't cause Misae-san trouble, right?
text @[Tomoya]
text Just follow the rules.
sound WP.aac
text @[Rugby club]
text I don't want to hear that from the likes of you. Can't even get to school on time.
text @[Tomoya]
text That might be true, but it has nothing to do with this. I had to help Misae-san out. She was really at the end of her rope with you guys.
sound WQ.aac
text @[Rugby club]
text What's with this guy? You trying to act like the only good guy around?
sound WR.aac
text @[Rugby club]
text You'd better not be trying to make any moves on Misae-san.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm not, but... Wait, what?
text @[Tomoya]
text Are you guys interested in Misae-san?
sound WS.aac
text @[Rugby club]
text What?
text They all look at each other.
text After a second, they all try to pretend that everything's normal, with stiff smiles on their faces.
text ...Agh, these guys really are just like elementary school boys.
text So they were causing Misae-san trouble because they wanted her to pay attention to them.
sound WT.aac
text @[Rugby club]
text Anyway...
sound WU.aac
text @[Rugby club]
text You don't live in this dorm, so stay away from Misae-san from now on.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound WV.aac
text @[Rugby club]
text Well?! What's your reply?!
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, I get it.
text There's no way for me to take on this many guys and win. I reply the way they want me to.
sound WW.aac
text @[Rugby club]
text Okay. As long as you understand.
text They all return to their rooms.
text @[Tomoya]
text (The one I really feel bad for is Misae-san. Having to spend every day surrounded by guys like that...?)
